              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "If you or someone you know is experiencing a mental health emergency, please seek immediate professional help. Call a crisis helpline (India: Snehi Helpline - 1860 266 2345 | iCall - +91 9582208181 ) Visit the nearest hospital or emergency care center. Reach out to a trusted family member or friend for support. eMbrace is not a crisis intervention platform. If you’re in immediate distress, please seek in-person psychiatric assistance."
