                  <div class="pb-4 text-sm sm:text-base break-words">
                    <div class="space-y-3">
                      <p class="text-[#234394] font-semibold">
                        While our therapists support individuals dealing with emotional distress, we do not offer
                        emergency suicide prevention services.
                      </p>
                      <div class="space-y-2">
                        <div class="flex items-start">
